config BR2_PACKAGE_FOURREEL_VO
	bool "4reel stereo visual odometry"
	depends on BR2_INSTALL_LIBSTDCPP
	help
	  Small on-device stereo visual odometry experiment using libviso2.
	  It requires rectified, synchronized cameras and measured calibration.
	  It is not a SLAM system and has no loop closure or NPU inference.

comment "4reel stereo visual odometry needs a C++ toolchain"
	depends on !BR2_INSTALL_LIBSTDCPP
